body:
who knew that exceptions handled in generators only emit GeneratorExit as a result of gc.  

try this program out on pypy and cpython:

```py
import gc

def go():
    try:
        for i in range(10):
            yield i
    except GeneratorExit:
        print("generator exit")


try:
    for num in go():
        print(num)
        if num > 3:
            raise Exception("hi")
except:
    print("exception raised")

    print("about to call gc collect")
    # GeneratorExit on pypy doesn't occur until gc collect
    gc.collect()
```
